        "cooked": "<p>In a game last night we had Forced Deployment in the Villain play area and 8 cards in the villain trash.<br>\nLegacy had the card (can’t remamber the name) that villains can’t <span class=\"bbcode-b\">play</span> cards in their turn.<br>\nIn this case what should we have done?</p>",
